<title>USA: Community Bank sees 14 pct asset growth.</title>
<headline>Community Bank sees 14 pct asset growth.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Bank System Inc said Thursday that over the 1997 first half, it expects to increase the value of its assets by 14 percent, to $1.5 billion.</p>
<p>It cited its acquisition of eight bank branches in western New York and 12 branches in northern New York.</p>
<p>The acquisitions, expected to close by mid-year, will add about $343 million in deposits and include the purchase of up to $95 million in loans.</p>
</text>
